{"id":"n49499-1-10","stage":2,"title":"당일 · 当日","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n49499-1-10-1","ko":"아버지가 돌아가신 사고 당일에 어디에 계셨습니까?","zh":"您父亲因事故去世的当天，您在哪里？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아버지가","meaning":"父亲，爸爸","explanation":"아버지：父亲，爸爸；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"아버지","audio":"/audio/af4870c15b98485bf462.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71343","senseId":"2","lemma":"아버지","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"돌아가신","meaning":"去世，逝世","explanation":"돌아가다：去世，逝世；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"돌아가다","audio":"/audio/1152d7a56fb1600a5774.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74103","senseId":"7","lemma":"돌아가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"사고","meaning":"事故","explanation":"사고：事故","readings":[{"term":"사고","audio":"/audio/2b04ea5b795422b77c61.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66370","senseId":"1","lemma":"사고","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"당일에","meaning":"当日，当天","explanation":"당일：当日，当天；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"당일","audio":"/audio/14c105e574e9c75e7ced.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"49499","senseId":"1","lemma":"당일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어디에","meaning":"哪里，哪儿","explanation":"어디：哪里，哪儿；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"어디","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60319","senseId":"1","lemma":"어디","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"계셨습니까?","meaning":"(尊称)身份高的人或长辈正在某个地方。","explanation":"계시다：(尊称)身份高的人或长辈正在某个地方。；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；습니까：正式礼貌的疑问句末。","readings":[{"term":"계시다","audio":"/audio/e0bef9809d26f11e8638.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17749","senseId":"2","lemma":"계시다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"af4870c15b98485b","term":"아버지","zh":"父亲，爸爸","audio":"/audio/af4870c15b98485bf462.mp3","entryId":"71343","definition":"在与子女有关的事情上用于指称或称呼有子女的男子。","pronunciation":["아버지"]},{"id":"1152d7a56fb1600a","term":"돌아가다","zh":"去世，逝世","audio":"/audio/1152d7a56fb1600a5774.mp3","entryId":"74103","definition":"(尊称)死去。","pronunciation":["도라가다"]},{"id":"2b04ea5b795422b7","term":"사고","zh":"事故","audio":"/audio/2b04ea5b795422b77c61.mp3","entryId":"66370","definition":"意料之外发生的不好的事情。","pronunciation":["사ː고"]},{"id":"14c105e574e9c75e","term":"당일","zh":"当日，当天","audio":"/audio/14c105e574e9c75e7ced.mp3","entryId":"49499","definition":"就是那天。","pronunciation":["당일"]},{"id":"c1ee1b7e560f9f3a","term":"어디","zh":"哪里，哪儿","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3","entryId":"60319","definition":"指代不知道的处所。","pronunciation":["어디"]},{"id":"e0bef9809d26f11e","term":"계시다","zh":"(尊称)身份高的人或长辈正在某个地方。","audio":"/audio/e0bef9809d26f11e8638.mp3","entryId":"17749","definition":"(尊称)身份高的人或长辈正在某个地方。","pronunciation":["계ː시다","게ː시다"]}],"audio":"/audio/32ab14fb786e903b5e1d.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n49499-1-10-2","ko":"회사에 있었습니다.","zh":"我在公司。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"회사에","meaning":"公司，企业，会社","explanation":"회사：公司，企业，会社；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"회사","audio":"/audio/a109dcd7f6f11c2e1703.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31668","senseId":"1","lemma":"회사","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있었습니다.","meaning":"在，待，住","explanation":"있다：在，待，住；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；습니다：正式礼貌的陈述句末。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"9","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"a109dcd7f6f11c2e","term":"회사","zh":"公司，企业，会社","audio":"/audio/a109dcd7f6f11c2e1703.mp3","entryId":"31668","definition":"想要通过事业获得利益的许多人一起建立的法人团体。","pronunciation":["회ː사","훼ː사"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"在，待，住","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"人或动物停留或居住在某个地方。","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/c5687bde3b8f6fe4c643.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":1.613,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/S